flowchart LR
    User[User] --> CLI[citationchecker check]
    Tex[LaTeX source/project] --> CLI
    PDF[PDF only] --> CLI

    subgraph Runtime[Deterministic Python runtime]
      Detect[Detect source type]
      Convert[PyMuPDF4LLM\nPDF -> Markdown]
      Stage[Stage manuscript]
      Freeze[Freeze SKILL.md + references]
      Gate[Verify final artifact schema]
    end

    CLI --> Detect
    Detect -->|LaTeX| Stage
    Detect -->|PDF only| Convert --> Stage
    Stage --> Freeze
    Freeze --> Pi[Pi harness]
    Pi --> Skill[CitationChecker skill]

    Skill --> Ref[RefChecker CLI]
    Ref -->|existence + metadata| Pi

    Skill --> Search[paper-search CLI]
    Search -->|search / abstract / full text| Pi

    Pi --> Judge[Claim-support reasoning]
    Judge --> Report[citation-report.md]
    Judge --> JSON[citation-report.json]
    Report --> Gate
    JSON --> Gate
